#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:84
msgid "Alloy generation is skipped, with a message in the report, unless ``alloys.alloy_species`` is set. As an example, to generate more distorted configurations, drop the slabs and generate alloys of B and N:"
msgstr "La gjenerazion des leghis e ven saltade, cuntun messaç tal report, fin che nol è impostât ``alloys.alloy_species``. Par esempli, chi sot si gjenerin plui configurazions distuartis, si gjavin i slab e si gjenerin leghis di B e N:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:96
msgid "The defaults target a production dataset and can take a long time on a small system. ``get_builder(..., demo=True)`` lowers the sizes for a first trial: slabs and alloys are switched off, and ``rsd.params.n_configs``, ``clusters.n_clusters``, ``clusters.max_atoms`` and ``replicate.max_atoms`` are set to 3, 3, 6 and 24."
msgstr "I valôrs predefinîts a mirin a un dataset di produzion e a puedin domandâ tant timp suntun sisteme piçul. ``get_builder(..., demo=True)`` al ridûs lis dimensions par une prime prove: slab e leghis a vegnin distudâts, e ``rsd.params.n_configs``, ``clusters.n_clusters``, ``clusters.max_atoms`` e ``replicate.max_atoms`` a vegnin metûts a 3, 3, 6 e 24."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:102
msgid "Label"
msgstr "Etichetâ"

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:104
msgid "The structures produced by the augmentation, and later those selected by the committee, have no energies, forces or stresses yet. ``builder.ab_initio_labelling`` computes them with Quantum ESPRESSO, running one calculation for each unlabelled structure of the dataset. ``get_builder`` fills ``ab_initio_labelling.quantumespresso`` from ``abinitiolabelling_protocol`` and ``pseudo_family``. It is a ``PwBaseWorkChain`` builder, so any of its inputs can be changed as for any other Quantum ESPRESSO calculation, for example the smearing:"
msgstr "Lis struturis produsudis de aumentazion, e dopo chês selezionadis dal comitât, no àn ancjemò energjiis, fuarcis o tensions. ``builder.ab_initio_labelling`` lis calcole cun Quantum ESPRESSO, fasint un calcul par ogni struture no etichetade dal dataset. ``get_builder`` al complete ``ab_initio_labelling.quantumespresso`` a partî di ``abinitiolabelling_protocol`` e ``pseudo_family``. Al è un builder di ``PwBaseWorkChain``, duncje ognidun dai siei input si pues cambiâlu come par cualsisei altri calcul di Quantum ESPRESSO, par esempli il smearing:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:119
msgid "Two other inputs are ``group_label`` (calculations are added to this group; a group named ``ab_initio_labelling_<uuid>`` is created if it is not given) and ``batch_size`` (structures labelled per batch, default ``1000``). The calculations are run with ``tstress`` and ``tprnfor`` enabled."
msgstr "Altris doi input a son ``group_label`` (i calcui a vegnin zontâts a chest grup; se nol ven dât, al ven creât un grup clamât ``ab_initio_labelling_<uuid>``) e ``batch_size`` (struturis etichetadis par lot, predefinît ``1000``). I calcui a zirin cun ``tstress`` e ``tprnfor`` ativâts."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:125
msgid "Train"
msgstr "Adestrâ"

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:127
msgid "``builder.training`` trains ``num_potentials`` independent potentials on the labelled dataset. They form the committee whose disagreement drives the selection of new structures, so at least two are needed. Before training, the labelled dataset is split into training, validation and test sets."
msgstr "``builder.training`` al adestre ``num_potentials`` potenziâi indipendents sul dataset etichetât. A formin il comitât il cui disacuardi al guide la selezion di gnovis struturis, duncje a 'nd coventin almancul doi. Prime dal adestrament, il dataset etichetât al ven dividût in insiemis di adestrament, di validazion e di test."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:131
msgid "``training.num_potentials``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:132
msgid "Default ``2``."
msgstr "Predefinît ``2``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:134
msgid "``training.non_training_fraction``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:135
msgid "Fraction of the dataset kept out of training and split between validation and test sets. Default ``0.2``. Input structures, isolated atoms and single-atom configurations always go to the training set."
msgstr "Frazion dal dataset tignude fûr dal adestrament e dividude tra i insiemis di validazion e di test. Predefinît ``0.2``. Lis struturis di input, i atoms isolâts e lis configurazions di un sôl atom a van simpri tal insiemi di adestrament."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:139
msgid "The inputs of the training engine itself sit under ``training.mace`` or ``training.meta``, matching ``training_engine``; the one for the other engine is left empty. For MACE:"
msgstr "I input dal motôr di adestrament stes a stan sot di ``training.mace`` o ``training.meta``, daûr di ``training_engine``; chel dal altri motôr al reste vueit. Par MACE:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:151
msgid "``postprocess_code`` is required for MACE. ``preprocess_code`` is read only if ``do_preprocess`` is ``True`` (default ``False``). For metatrain the config is ``training.meta.train.meta_config`` and there is no post-processing code. The choice of engine is described in :ref:`production-engine`."
msgstr "``postprocess_code`` al è obligatori par MACE. ``preprocess_code`` al ven let dome se ``do_preprocess`` al è ``True`` (predefinît ``False``). Par metatrain la configurazion e je ``training.meta.train.meta_config`` e nol è nissun codiç di post-elaborazion. La sielte dal motôr e je descrite in :ref:`production-engine`."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:158
msgid "Explore"
msgstr "Esplorâ"

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:160
msgid "The training set only covers the configurations it contains, so the next question is where the potentials fail. ``builder.exploration`` runs LAMMPS molecular dynamics with one of the freshly trained potentials, starting from structures of the dataset, and samples frames from the trajectories; these are the candidates for labelling. The inputs below control what is simulated and how it is sampled."
msgstr "L'insiemi di adestrament al cuvierç dome lis configurazions che al conten, e duncje la domande dopo e je dulà che i potenziâi a falin. ``builder.exploration`` al fâs zirâ dinamiche molecolâr LAMMPS cuntun dai potenziâi apene adestrâts, partint di struturis dal dataset, e al cjol fotograms des trajetoriis; chescj a son i candidâts pe etichetadure. I input chi sot a controlin ce che al ven simulât e cemût che al ven campionât."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:166
msgid "``params_list``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:167
msgid "List of MD runs. ``get_builder`` sets a single one: 300 K, zero pressure, ``nvt``, 50 steps of 0.001. ``generate_lammps_md_config`` builds a list from lists of temperatures, pressures, step counts and integration styles; every combination becomes one run:"
msgstr "Liste des esecuzions MD. ``get_builder`` int impueste une sole: 300 K, pression zero, ``nvt``, 50 pas di 0.001. ``generate_lammps_md_config`` al costruìs une liste a partî di listis di temperaduris, pressions, numars di pas e stii di integrazion; ogni combinazion e devente une esecuzion:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:185
msgid "The same ``dt`` has to be passed to the function and set as ``control.timestep``: the function uses it to set the thermostat and barostat damping times (100 and 1000 timesteps), and ``exploration.parameters[\"control\"][\"timestep\"]`` is required."
msgstr "Il stes ``dt`` al à di jessi passât ae funzion e impostât come ``control.timestep``: la funzion lu dopre par impostâ i timps di smorzament dal termostat e dal barostat (100 e 1000 pas di timp), e ``exploration.parameters[\"control\"][\"timestep\"]`` al è obligatori."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:189
msgid "``sampling_time``, ``thermalization_time``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:190
msgid "Interval between extracted frames (default ``1.0``) and initial time discarded (default ``0.0``), in LAMMPS time units. Their sum must not exceed the shortest run, ``min(steps) * timestep``. ``get_builder`` sets ``sampling_time`` to ``0.01``, a fifth of its default run."
msgstr "Interval tra i fotograms estrats (predefinît ``1.0``) e timp iniziâl scartât (predefinît ``0.0``), in unitâts di timp di LAMMPS. La lôr sume no à di superâ la esecuzion plui curte, ``min(steps) * timestep``. ``get_builder`` al impueste ``sampling_time`` a ``0.01``, un cuint de sô esecuzion predefinide."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:195
msgid "``potential_pair_style``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:196
msgid "The LAMMPS ``pair_style`` of the trained potentials. Default ``\"mace no_domain_decomposition\"``. A value the training engine cannot produce is replaced by that engine's default, and the change is written in the report. See :ref:`production-engine`."
msgstr "Il ``pair_style`` LAMMPS dai potenziâi adestrâts. Predefinît ``\"mace no_domain_decomposition\"``. Un valôr che il motôr di adestrament nol pues produsi al ven sostituît cul valôr predefinît di chel motôr, e il cambiament al ven scrit tal report. Cjale :ref:`production-engine`."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:200
msgid "``protocol``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:201
msgid "``None`` or ``\"vdw_d2\"``, set by the ``md_protocol`` argument of ``get_builder``. With ``\"vdw_d2\"`` the potential is combined with a DFT-D2 dispersion correction through ``pair_style hybrid/overlay``."
msgstr "``None`` o ``\"vdw_d2\"``, impostât dal argoment ``md_protocol`` di ``get_builder``. Cun ``\"vdw_d2\"`` il potenziâl al ven combinât cuntune corezion di dispersion DFT-D2 traviers di ``pair_style hybrid/overlay``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:205
msgid "``check_vacuum``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:206
msgid "Default ``True``. Enlarges the vacuum along non-periodic directions of the extracted frames."
msgstr "Predefinît ``True``. Al slargje il vueit lungjo lis direzions no periodichis dai fotograms estrats."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:208
msgid "Which structures the MD starts from is chosen at the top level of the builder: ``random_input_structures_lammps`` (default ``True``) and ``num_random_structures_lammps`` (default ``20``) select how many structures of the dataset are used as MD starting points, skipping single atoms. A fixed set can be given instead with ``lammps_input_structures``, a ``PESData`` node, and ``random_input_structures_lammps = Bool(False)``."
msgstr "Lis struturis di partence de MD si lis sielç al nivel plui alt dal builder: ``random_input_structures_lammps`` (predefinît ``True``) e ``num_random_structures_lammps`` (predefinît ``20``) a stabilissin cuantis struturis dal dataset a vegnin dopradis come pont di partence de MD, lassant fûr i atoms singui. Al so puest si pues dâ un insiemi fis cun ``lammps_input_structures``, un grop ``PESData``, e ``random_input_structures_lammps = Bool(False)``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:214
msgid "LAMMPS settings can be passed through ``builder.exploration.md.lammps.settings``, for example ``additional_cmdline_params`` for GPU options, and the structure and thermo output parameters through ``builder.exploration.parameters``."
msgstr "Lis impostazions di LAMMPS si puedin passâ traviers di ``builder.exploration.md.lammps.settings``, par esempli ``additional_cmdline_params`` pes opzions GPU, e i parametris di output de struture e des grandecis termodinamichis traviers di ``builder.exploration.parameters``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:219
msgid "Evaluate"
msgstr "Valutâ"

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:221
msgid "The last stage decides which of the explored frames are worth labelling. ``builder.committee_evaluation`` evaluates the explored frames, and the labelled dataset, with every potential of the committee. The deviation among the members is a measure of how uncertain the committee is on a frame. Frames whose deviation is above the thresholds are added to the dataset and labelled in the next loop."
msgstr "La ultime fase e decît cuai dai fotograms esplorâts che a meretin di jessi etichetâts. ``builder.committee_evaluation`` al valute i fotograms esplorâts, e il dataset etichetât, cun ogni potenziâl dal comitât. La deviazion tra i membris e je une misure di trop incert che al è il comitât suntun fotogram. I fotograms cuntune deviazion parsore dai limits a vegnin zontâts al dataset e etichetâts tal cicli sucessîf."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:236
msgid "``thr_energy``, ``thr_forces``, ``thr_stress``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:237
msgid "Defaults ``0.001``, ``0.1`` and ``0.001``. A frame is selected if any of its energy, forces or stress deviations exceeds the corresponding threshold. The thresholds are expressed in units of the error: at each loop they are multiplied by the slope of a linear fit, through the origin, of the committee deviation against the RMSE on the labelled dataset (the calibration shown by ``plot_error_calibration``)."
msgstr "Predefinîts ``0.001``, ``0.1`` e ``0.001``. Un fotogram al ven selezionât se une cualsisei des sôs deviazions di energjie, fuarcis o tension e supere il limit corispondent. I limits a son esprimûts in unitâts dal erôr: a ogni cicli a vegnin moltiplicâts pe pendence di un fit lineâr, passant pe origjin, de deviazion dal comitât in funzion dal RMSE sul dataset etichetât (la calibrazion mostrade di ``plot_error_calibration``)."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:243
msgid "``max_selected_frames``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:244
msgid "Maximum number of frames selected per loop. Default ``1000``. If more frames pass the thresholds, a random subset is kept."
msgstr "Numar massim di fotograms selezionâts par cicli. Predefinît ``1000``. Se a passin i limits plui fotograms, si 'nt ten un sotinsiemi casuâl."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:247
msgid "The committee evaluation is run as a ``PortableCode`` with no computer of its own, so ``committee_evaluation.metadata.computer`` has to be set together with ``committee_evaluation.code``."
msgstr "La valutazion dal comitât e zire come ``PortableCode`` cence un computer so, duncje ``committee_evaluation.metadata.computer`` al à di jessi impostât adun cun ``committee_evaluation.code``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:251
msgid "Outputs"
msgstr "Output"

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:253
msgid "When the workflow finishes, its main results are available as outputs of the process node."
msgstr "Cuant che il flus di lavôr al finìs, i siei risultâts principâi a son disponibii come output dal grop dal procès."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:255
msgid "``dataset``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:256
msgid "The final dataset: labelled structures plus the structures selected in the last loop."
msgstr "Il dataset finâl: lis struturis etichetadis plui lis struturis selezionadis tal ultin cicli."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:258
msgid "``models_lammps``, ``models_ase``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:259
msgid "The last committee, compiled for LAMMPS and for ASE. For MACE, ``models_lammps_mliap`` is also present when the post-processing step produced the ``mliap`` format."
msgstr "L'ultin comitât, compilât par LAMMPS e par ASE. Par MACE al è ancje ``models_lammps_mliap``, cuant che il pas di post-elaborazion al à produsût il formât ``mliap``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:262
msgid "``checkpoints``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:263
msgid "Last checkpoints of the trained potentials."
msgstr "Ultins checkpoint dai potenziâi adestrâts."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:265
msgid "``RMSE``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:266
msgid "RMSE on the labelled dataset for each loop."
msgstr "RMSE sul dataset etichetât par ogni cicli."

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:268
msgid "``explored_dataset``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user_guide/loop_stages.rst:269
msgid "Frames sampled in the last successful exploration."
msgstr "Fotograms campionâts te ultime esplorazion lade a bon fin."
